        "name": "USN-4487-2",
        "description": "USN-4487-1 fixed several vulnerabilities in libx11. This update provides the corresponding update for Ubuntu 12.04 ESM and 14.04 ESM.  Original advisory details:   Todd Carson discovered that libx11 incorrectly handled certain memory  operations. A local attacker could possibly use this issue to escalate  privileges. (CVE-2020-14344)   Jayden Rivers discovered that libx11 incorrectly handled locales. A local  attacker could possibly use this issue to escalate privileges.  (CVE-2020-14363)",
        "aliases": [
          "CVE-2020-14344",
          "CVE-2020-14363"
        ]
      },
